    <EquipmentModule:has_Serial_Number>SN-ADV-BUS002-62350</EquipmentModule:has_Serial_Number>
    <rdfs:label>Medium-voltage platform switchgear/bus - 75 MW</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Medium-voltage platform switchgear/bus, 75 MW rated capacity. Unlike turbines/panels/cables, bus/switchgear capacity is a platform-sizing design choice rather than a single named market SKU -- this ascending range (50MW-3500MW) exists so future scenarios have a correctly-sized bus available without needing a one-off scenario-level individual. has_Generator_Efficiency (0.99) matches the existing BUS_1..5 near-lossless-switchgear convention.</rdfs:comment>
    <EquipmentModule:hasIdentifier>SN-ADV-BUS002-62350</EquipmentModule:hasIdentifier>
    <EquipmentModule:hasGeneratorEfficiency rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.99</EquipmentModule:hasGeneratorEfficiency>
