  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.usp.ai/Ontologies/FPEO/EquipmentModule">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/2020/bfo.owl"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>Patched 2026-08-14: corrected has_Max_Power on GasTurbine_30 (300MW-&gt;30MW), GasTurbine_50 (500MW-&gt;50MW), SolarPanel_40 (30MW-&gt;40MW), and BUS_3 (100MW-&gt;1000MW) -- all four were name/sibling-value mismatches flagged by otic_rdf_parser.py's defect checks, corrected to align with the individual's naming convention / sibling magnitude. See CHANGELOG_EquipmentModule.md.</owl:versionInfo>
    <owl:versionInfo>v4: added 30 new individuals for EACH of the 5 existing equipment types (SolarPanel, WindTurbine, GasTurbine, PowerCable, ElectricalBus) = 150 new individuals total, built on top of the corrected (v2) baseline. Supersedes v3 (which only expanded SolarPanel/WindTurbine). See CHANGELOG_EquipmentModule_v4.md for full documentation.</owl:versionInfo>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="http://www.usp.ai/Ontologies/FPEO/EquipmentModule/versions/2026-08-21"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">V5 candidate: production EquipmentModule content is preserved additively; its BFO 2019 import is replaced only in this candidate by the canonical BFO 2020 import. The original production file remains unchanged in PRODUCTION_BASELINE.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
