    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">What it is: legacy FPEO entity PowerCable, preserved from the production ontology. BFO/IOF placement: inherited from its existing asserted hierarchy. Why it is here: retained unchanged at the public IRI to preserve production Python, SPARQL, Protégé, and scenario compatibility.</rdfs:comment>
